       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SANSC9.
      * WATCH-LIST LOADER FOR MANDATED SANCTIONS LISTS
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY SANTB9.
       01  WS-ENTRY-COUNT            PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-LOADED                 PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-LOAD-STATUS            PIC X(6) VALUE 'SKIP'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-FEED-CODE
           ACCEPT WS-ENTRY-COUNT
           PERFORM 2000-LOAD
           DISPLAY 'STATUS: ' WS-LOAD-STATUS
           DISPLAY 'LOADED: ' WS-LOADED
           STOP RUN.
       2000-LOAD.
           IF MANDATED-WATCH-LIST
              MOVE WS-ENTRY-COUNT TO WS-LOADED
              MOVE 'LOAD' TO WS-LOAD-STATUS
           ELSE
              MOVE 'SKIP' TO WS-LOAD-STATUS
           END-IF.
